      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{NH}_2 \\mathrm{NH}_2, \\stackrel{(-)}{\\mathrm{OH}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "e0S6k",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{Zn}-\\mathrm{Hg} / \\mathrm{HCl}$\n",
